It does not cover the rest of this repository. Swing is commercial software
under its own terms (see ../LICENSE.md), the knob/slider/meter libraries ship
as part of the ReaKit bundle under its terms, and vu_kbsg.jsfx-inc additionally
contains third-party VU ports under their own licences (see ReaKit/README.md,
"Gotchas").

